# The synced data files are rewritten wholesale by sync scripts that run both
# in CI (committing to main) and locally, so git sees a whole-file conflict on
# every merge. scripts/merge-sync-json.mjs resolves them per document, and
# refuses whenever an EDITORIAL field (CLAUDE.md hard rule 5) disagrees.
#
# The driver has to be REGISTERED in .git/config per clone — git will not run
# a driver a repository merely names. Run:  npm run setup:git
src/data/videos.json          merge=sync-json
src/data/articles.json        merge=sync-json
src/data/instagram.json       merge=sync-json
src/data/article-images.json  merge=sync-json
